[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1209","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0563","title":"Apple MacOS Runtime Java MRJ 与 Microsoft VM for MacOS java.net.URLConnection HTTP 重定向任意主机连接漏洞","description":"MacOS Runtime Java (MRJ) 2.1 及更早版本以及 MacOS 版 Microsoft 虚拟机中的 URLConnection 函数存在安全模型绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过恶意网站利用 HTTP 重定向绕过 Java 安全模型的沙箱限制，强制 Java 应用程序连接任意远程主机。该漏洞影响运行 MRJ 2.1 及更早版本的 MacOS 系统以及使用 Microsoft VM for MacOS 的环境，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重）。攻击者只需诱导用户访问恶意网页，即可通过 HTTP 重定向绕过 Java 沙箱限制，建立任意网络连接，可能导致敏感信息泄露、内网探测或进一步攻击内网主机。Apple 和 Microsoft 已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议升级至 MRJ 2.2 或更高版本，或升级 Microsoft VM 至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0563"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00.303","remediation":"建议立即卸载或禁用 MacOS Runtime Java (MRJ) 2.1 及更早版本、Microsoft VM for MacOS 等受影响 Java 虚拟机。因上述产品早已停止维护无官方补丁，建议彻底卸载 Java 插件或在浏览器中彻底禁用 Java 插件。如必须保留 Java 环境，请在防火墙层面禁止 Java 进程发起任意出站 HTTP 连接，并部署网络层出站访问控制策略限制 Java 进程仅访问受信任目标 IP 段。建议迁移至现代受支持的 Java 运行环境（如 OpenJDK 17+ LTS 版本）并配置安全管理器限制网络权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0056.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1336","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-05-8&msg=391C95DE2DA.5E3BTAKAGI%40java-house.etl.go.jp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0563.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0563","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0563.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0563.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p854-gmj6-9jfw/GHSA-p854-gmj6-9jfw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0563.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1336/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0563.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0951","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0951.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0802","title":"Personal Privacy 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"BAIR 程序（个人隐私保护工具）未正确限制对 Internet Explorer Internet 选项菜单的访问权限，导致本地用户可通过修改启动 BAIR 程序的注册表键值来绕过限制，从而获取对 IE 安全设置的访问权限。该漏洞影响使用 BAIR 程序的系统，攻击者需要拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较低。成功利用后，攻击者可修改 IE 安全设置，可能导致信息泄露或权限提升。CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0802"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30.690","remediation":"立即卸载 BAIR 软件，改用支持现代 Windows 版本的内容过滤方案（如 Microsoft Family Safety 或第三方 Web 过滤软件）。如必须继续使用 BAIR，通过组策略（gpedit.msc）限制非管理员用户对注册表 `HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run` 路径的写入权限，防止本地用户删除 BAIR 启动项绕过过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96430372326912&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0802","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0802.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xvx7-78wp-jmp4/GHSA-xvx7-78wp-jmp4.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9137939e-2052-4810-8a09-aa1bd646cc57.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/04a9a8381d346b006d2615d73d55f4e286759f63/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--9137939e-2052-4810-8a09-aa1bd646cc57.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0951.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0950","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0950.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0801","title":"HP HP-UX bdf 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.00 系统中的 bdf 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 -t 选项传递超长参数触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获取 root 权限，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 11.00 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0801"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30.567","remediation":"立即安装 HP 官方安全补丁 HPSBUX0007-066（对应 HP-UX 11.00 的 bdf 缓冲区溢出修复）。如无法打补丁，可临时移除 bdf 程序的 setuid root 权限：`chmod 755 /usr/bin/bdf`，或通过文件权限控制仅允许受信任用户执行 bdf 命令。鉴于 HP-UX 11.00 已停止维护，建议升级到受支持的 HP-UX 版本（如 11i v3）以获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0388.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1520","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0801","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0801.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8hw5-ppqj-684g/GHSA-8hw5-ppqj-684g.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1520/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--79693ffb-59f1-43e4-91c8-bcadd49108fc.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0950.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0949","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0949.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0792","title":"GNOME Lokkit 防火墙安全绕过漏洞","description":"Gnome Lokkit 防火墙软件包 0.41 之前版本存在端口访问控制不当漏洞。该防火墙未能正确限制对部分端口的访问，即使用户未开放任何服务，攻击者仍可绕过防火墙规则直接访问受保护端口。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过网络发送特制请求绕过防火墙策略，导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。攻击条件简单，无需认证即可远程触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0792"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29.440","remediation":"升级 gnome-lokkit 至 0.41 或更高版本，该版本已修复端口访问控制逻辑，确保未开放服务对应的端口被正确限制。如无法升级，可结合 iptables 手动配置防火墙规则，显式拒绝非必要端口的入站连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0252.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1520","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1590","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0792","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0792.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4d465198ab8436491a7618e7789ef7adce4c01e0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9m5v-hm6x-m9g5/GHSA-9m5v-hm6x-m9g5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0949.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0948","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0948.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0791","title":"Trustix Apache-SSL 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Trustix Linux 发行版在安装 Apache-SSL 的 httpsd 程序时，错误地将其设置为全局可写权限（world-writeable），导致本地普通用户可利用该权限配置缺陷，直接将 httpsd 二进制文件替换为特洛伊木马程序。当系统重启或服务重新启动时，被替换的恶意程序将以 httpsd 原有权限（通常为 root 权限）执行，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Trustix 系统中使用 Apache-SSL 组件的版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0791"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29.327","remediation":"立即检查 httpsd 程序文件权限，执行 `chmod 755 /path/to/httpsd` 移除全局可写权限；升级 Trustix 至最新版本或迁移至受支持的 Linux 发行版；部署文件完整性监控（如 AIDE/Tripwire）定期校验关键二进制文件哈希值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0179.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1575","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0791","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0791.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4d465198ab8436491a7618e7789ef7adce4c01e0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h8j5-33x3-h6g9/GHSA-h8j5-33x3-h6g9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1575/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f35d837b-9608-4571-83d5-482c9bffe62e.json","https://github.com/victorVikeethLobo/Vuln_VAS/blob/7e5ef3a16d37cb353d7594717fc738dad4b784b4/cve_dataset.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0948.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0947","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0947.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0790","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 本地木马程序植入漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5（Windows 98 版本）的 Web 文件夹显示功能存在特洛伊木马植入漏洞。本地用户可通过修改 Folder.htt 文件，并利用 ShellDefView ActiveX 控件中的 InvokeVerb 方法，将文件夹中列出的第一个文件指定为默认执行选项，从而植入并执行特洛伊木马程序。该漏洞影响 Windows 98 平台上的 IE 5.5，攻击者需具有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0790"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29.193","remediation":"升级到 Windows 2000 或更高版本操作系统，并安装 Internet Explorer 6.0 或更高版本。如无法升级系统，可手动删除或重命名 %windir%\\web\\Folder.htt 文件以禁用 Web 视图模式，或在文件夹选项中关闭「Web 视图」功能，改为使用传统 Windows 文件夹风格。同时建议禁用 ShellDefView ActiveX 控件的 InvokeVerb 方法，通过注册表设置相关 kill bit 来阻止该控件的调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1571","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=3998370D.732A03F1%40nat.bg","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5097","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0790","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0790.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2dd0160b9ec0105216522022a89e49e69be74f7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8m5q-4p59-97f5/GHSA-8m5q-4p59-97f5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7f4946aa-7b7b-4b7a-b0b7-a60bb7290fa3.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0947.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0946","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0946.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0789","title":"Bardon Data Systems WinU 密码弱加密漏洞","description":"Bardon Data Systems WinU 5.x 及更早版本使用弱加密算法存储其配置密码，本地攻击者可通过分析加密后的密码文件，利用其加密强度不足的缺陷还原出明文密码，从而获取系统管理权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响 WinU 全系列早期版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0789"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29.067","remediation":"立即升级 WinU 至 6.0 或更高版本（如厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至其他密码管理工具）。若无法升级，限制本地非授权用户对 WinU 配置文件的读取权限（如 Windows ACL 仅允许 Administrators 组访问），并避免在多用户共享系统上使用该软件存储敏感密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0201.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0789.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0789","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0789.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0789.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d99b1b66d0cac20b8bc92baa53c2