文件，禁用 importmotd 命令或将 IRC 操作员权限降级为普通用户；2）在服务器上移除或重命名 importmotd 相关功能模块；3）迁移至仍在维护的 IRC 服务器软件（如 UnrealIRCd 或 InspIRCd），避免使用已停止维护的 WircSrv。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96353027909756&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0785","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0785.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a63d131cc61df62c077c7700617ad6343ec52ef/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7qg4-rqjp-rwv5/GHSA-7qg4-rqjp-rwv5.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9f501659-9048-4089-9a6b-632082ec29e0.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--9f501659-9048-4089-9a6b-632082ec29e0.owl","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b80121dc73e23dd13187ec16e91cd79074cff1b7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0785.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0944.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0941","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0941.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0783","title":"WatchGuard Firebox II 认证服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WatchGuard Firebox II 认证服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标设备的 4100 端口发送特制的畸形 URL，触发认证服务处理异常，导致服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求。该漏洞影响 WatchGuard Firebox II 系列防火墙设备，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，可被用于中断企业网络安全防护服务。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0783"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28.320","remediation":"建议立即升级 WatchGuard Firebox II 固件至最新版本（厂商已针对此漏洞发布补丁）。如无法升级，可在防火墙上配置访问控制规则，限制仅允许可信 IP 地址访问 TCP 端口 4100（认证服务），或直接在内网边界阻断对该端口的非授权外部访问，以缓解远程拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0162.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1573","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5098","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0783.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0783","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0783.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0783.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3cf2-6pj6-x5w3/GHSA-3cf2-6pj6-x5w3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0783.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cce49359-fe6b-4c2e-bd4e-32bc2500cb30.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0941.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0938","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0938.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0781","title":"CA ARCServeIT Client Agent 本地任意命令执行漏洞","description":"ARCServeIT Client Agent 6.62 中的 uagentsetup 组件在将临时文件移动至 agent.cfg 配置文件时，未正确检查该临时文件的存在性及所有权归属，导致本地攻击者可通过在临时文件被移动前对其进行篡改，注入恶意命令，从而实现以目标进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 ARCServeIT Client Agent 6.62 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致系统完全受控。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0781"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28.070","remediation":"立即升级 ARCServeIT Client Agent 至 6.63 或更高版本，该版本已修复临时文件竞争条件问题。如无法升级，确保 agent.cfg 所在目录权限为 755 且仅允许受信管理员账户登录系统，同时在系统层监控 /tmp 目录下 uagentsetup 创建的临时文件操作日志，防止本地低权限用户通过符号链接攻击篡改配置文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0431.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1519","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5023","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0781","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0781.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/74884340187670a91b9d5bdb799b52e73426ad63/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fq8g-x6c4-fpm3/GHSA-fq8g-x6c4-fpm3.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1519/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/864adb9ddf294417a5a4e84f90f9adf54e9dca89/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0938.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0935","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0935.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0779","title":"Checkpoint Firewall-1 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Checkpoint Firewall-1 在启用 RSH/REXEC 服务时存在安全绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标防火墙发送特制的畸形连接请求，绕过访问控制规则限制，直接连接到受保护的 RSH/REXEC 客户端服务。该漏洞影响 Checkpoint Firewall-1 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击无需身份认证，利用复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露、权限提升或服务被非法访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0779"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27.823","remediation":"立即禁用 Firewall-1 的 RSH/REXEC 服务：在防火墙策略中删除或注释掉允许 RSH（TCP 514）和 REXEC（TCP 512）的规则；如业务必须使用，升级到 Check Point 官方已修复版本（NG FP1 及以上），并在规则中限制仅允许特定源 IP 访问。对于已停止支持的旧版本，建议迁移到受支持的 Firewall 版本并启用应用控制功能拦截异常 RSH 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#Improper_stderr","http://www.osvdb.org/1487","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1534","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0779.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0779","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0779.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70d